msgid ""
"Stop syncing “{path}”?\n"
"\n"
"This folder is online only: its files live in Proton Drive, not on this "
"disk, so the folder will be empty once it stops syncing. To keep a local "
"copy, cancel, switch the folder to Synced, and wait for the download to "
"finish before removing it."
